stitute for Management Studies Outdoor Leadership & Education Warrior Coffee Project Resources Academic Calendar Library Registrar IT Services Academic Services Deans Accessibility Services Tutoring Services Career & Professional Development First-Year & Transfer Students Parents Student Life Student Life Home Campus Life Clubs & Organizations Outdoor Leadership & Education Campus Recreation Community Service Fraternity & Sorority Life Student Engagement Resources Commuter Students International Students Student Handbook Social Media Portal Event Calendar Williamsport & the Area More Residential Life Counseling Services Health Services Public Safety Campus Dining myLyco Athletics Athletics Home Men's Sports Baseball Basketball Cross Country Football Golf Lacrosse Soccer Swimming Tennis Volleyball Wrestling Women's Sports Basketball Cross Country Field Hockey Lacrosse Soccer Softball Swimming Tennis Volleyball Cheerleading Resources All-Americans Athletic Calendar Athletic Hall of Fame Compliance Facilities Recreation Center In the Press Student-Athlete Advisory Committee Staff Directory Summer Camps Alumni Alumni Home Attend Events Regional Events Alumni & Reunion Weekend Homecoming Weekend Make a Gift Make a Gift Ways to Give Lycoming's Priorities Warrior Club Athletics Planned Giving Resources Matching Gifts See Your Impact Your Impact President's Report Donor Recognition Alumni in Action Alumni Association Executive Board Alumni Council for Fraternity & Sorority Life President's Leadership Council Warrior Club Advisory Council Lycoming College Magazine Submit a Class Note Alumni Resources Advancement Staff Alumni Referral Scholarship Become a Reunion Volunteer Buy a Brick Job Connections Request a Transcript Specialty License Plate Tailgating View Yearbooks More Popular Links Your Impact Events Academic Calendar Snowden Library Campus Store Employment Opportunities Info & Directories Offices & Services Campus Directory Majors, Minors & Programs Faculty Map & Directions Students, Faculty & Staff myLyco Lyco Advisor Email Moodle Manage Password Home Admissions Congratulations Warrior! You applied. You stood out. And now, you're part of something bigger. At Lycoming, you won't just choose a path—you'll explore it, shape it, and make it your own. You'll challenge yourself, discover new perspectives, and take advantage of opportunities that stretch far beyond the classroom. Now it's time to make it official. Submit Your Deposit Secure Your Spot To reserve your place in Lycoming's Class of 2031, submit your enrollment deposit by May 1. Submit Your Deposit You can pay online, via mail, or by phone through the Office of Admissions. Have questions? Email us or call us at 1 (800) 345-3920. Complete the FAFSA You've already been considered for merit-based scholarships as part of your admission, but we encourage all families to file the Free Application for Federal Student Aid (FAFSA) . Submitting the FAFSA helps us provide the most accurate financial aid package possible. Even if you don't expect to qualify for need-based aid, you may still be eligible for grants, loans, work-study, or other assistance. You'll also receive a $1,000 FAFSA Filer Grant just for applying. Don’t forget to enter Lycoming’s school code: 003293. Register for Accepted Students Day Now that you're admitted, it's time to see Lycoming in a new way. Without the stress of applications and deadlines, you'll gain a fresh perspective on what it really means to be a Warrior. Meet faculty, current students, and future classmates. Join in on student activities. And most importantly, celebrate your big accomplishment with us! Honestly, it's one of our favorite days of the year. Accepted Students Day April 4, 2027 Register Now Sign Up for Warrior Day Warrior Day is your summer orientation. For those within traveling distance, this is your opportunity to get acclimated to life as a Lycoming student. You'll meet with faculty and advisors, learn about campus resources, and get any last-minute questions answered. Sign Up Continue the Celebration! If you've made it official, it's time to celebrate—whether that means an Instagram-worthy bed party, a small family gathering, or a big bash with friends. We have party printables ready to bring out your Warrior spirit, from cupcake and straw toppers to banners, grad cap décor, and thank you notes! Party Printables Start Your Lyco Bucket List Wondering what your Lycoming experience will look like? Take our interactive quiz to start building your Lyco Bucket List. Take the Quiz Ready to Take the Next Step? Submit Your Deposit Talk with Admissions Take a Virtual Tour Back to top Apply Now Request Info Visit Lycoming Admissions Academics Student Life Athletics Alumni Library Job Openings Offices & Services Campus Store Campus Map myLyco Contact Us Select a page… Admissions Academics Student Life Athletics Alumni Library Job Openings Offices & Services Campus Store Campus Map myLyco Contact Us Privacy Policy Consumer Information One College Place, Williamsport, PA 17701-5192 (570) 321-4000 / 1 (800) 345-3920 © 2026 Lycoming College. All Rights Reserved."
    },
